{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Demo Information</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can experience the first three rooms, including the tutorial room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alice in the Manor</strong> is a point-and-click escape adventure game.  <br>You must explore every corner of a large manor filled with various puzzles and gimmicks and escape safely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, a mysterious letter arrives for Alice.  <br>It was none other than an admission letter from a magic school.  <br>However, to be admitted, she must pass a special test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The test takes place in an old manor.  <br>Inside, suspicious rooms and secret puzzles await Alice.  <br>Will Alice be able to complete this mysterious test and enter the magic school? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A variety of creative puzzles and gimmicks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fun of searching for and collecting clues</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Numerous rooms with different themes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An intuitive hint system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warm and charming graphics</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3840840?t=1755202073","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3840840?t=1755202073","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840840/097106c9d9802ae6740940d4b139ab04fd133a4a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755202073","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840840/097106c9d9802ae6740940d4b139ab04fd133a4a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755202073","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","i